\f0\fs24 \cf0 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Move your source-reconstructed brain voxel (or channel) datasets into the respective folders.\
Each folder should contain 
\f1\b one .mat file per participant
\f0\b0 .\uc0\u8232 Each .mat file should contain 
\f1\b a single data matrix
\f0\b0  in 
\f2\i voxels-by-time
\f0\i0  format.\
You can add as many folders as needed, depending on how many 
\f1\b Groups
\f0\b0  or 
\f1\b Conditions
\f0\b0  your experiment includes.\
The script 
\f1\b FREQNESS_MainPipeline.m
\f0\b0  will automatically import all participant data from the folder structure and run the full set of analyses, enabling you to compare FREQ-NESS outputs across 
\f1\b Groups
\f0\b0  or 
\f1\b Conditions
\f0\b0 .\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

